  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p>SAM+LEO is a teen-focused wellness brand dedicated to supporting mental and physical health through natural gummy vitamins. Founded by a mother committed to improving teen wellness, SAM+LEO is designed to make a positive impact on young lives.</p><p><strong>Product Description:</strong> Our product line includes five natural gummy SKUs targeting specific wellness needs—Relax, Immunity (cold/flu), Energy, Eyes+, and Sleep each crafted to boost teens' health while being easy to incorporate into daily routines. Every product comes in eco-friendly plastic pouches to support sustainability.</p><p>SAM+LEO is one of the first supplement brands designed specifically for teens' unique needs, chosen for the Whole Foods’ LEAP accelerator program. With a commitment to quality ingredients and accessible wellness, SAM+LEO meets young people's needs in a fun, approachable way.</p><p><strong>Earn a 15% commission on every order.</strong></p><p>SAM+LEO is more than a supplement brand; it's a movement for teen wellness. We actively support mental health through community involvement and practical resources, and we’re eager to partner with affiliates who share our passion for empowering the next generation. Join us in making wellness accessible!</p></div>",
